    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Start with log delivery, then investigate the affected service.** MQTT sources → TACTIC ingress → MQTT proxy → TimescaleDB / accepted MQTT → RADAR. Dojo replays stored datasets. Use the dashboard links above for detail.\n\nThese are **log observations**, not uptime, desired replica counts, queue depth, or an SLO. A quiet service may be healthy or unavailable. No observations stays empty; zero only means no matching events in a source that emitted logs. Retention: seven days."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Log delivery · check this before trusting silence",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
